{"id": "unknown-2026-07-09-006", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Argentina awards 700.5 MW of battery storage across critical grid nodes", "content": "<p>Argentina has awarded 20 battery energy storage system (BESS) projects to five developers under the AlmaSADI tender, with an estimated investment of $700 million to strengthen the national grid outside the Buenos Aires metropolitan area. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/argentina-awards-700-5-mw-of-battery-storage-across-critical-grid-nodes/\">Argentina awards 700.5 MW of battery storage across critical grid nodes</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-ma", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/argentina-awards-700-5-mw-of-battery-storage-across-critical-grid-nodes/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-09-007", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Spain launches national map of agrivoltaic projects", "content": "<p>The country’s first national map of agrivoltaic projects tracks operational and planned installations through a validated geolocation database. The initiative aims to improve transparency, support planning, and provide standardized data as Spain develops its regulatory framework for agrivoltaics.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/spain-launches-national-map-of-agrivoltaic-projects/\">Spain launches national map of agrivoltaic projects</a> appeared first on <a href", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/spain-launches-national-map-of-agrivoltaic-projects/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "longi-2026-07-09-008", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["longi"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Longi starts 21 GW production of copper-metallized back-contact solar cells", "content": "<p>The Chinese manufacturer has started production at a 21 GW back-contact cell facility in China, marking the first large-scale deployment of its silver-free Alloy Contact Matrix (ACM) metallization technology.<br />\nThe copper-based process aims to reduce costs, improve BC cell competitiveness, and support wider industrial adoption of back-contact modules.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/longi-switches-on-21-gw-production-line-for-copper-metallized-back-contact-", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/longi-switches-on-21-gw-production-line-for-copper-metallized-back-contact-solar-cells/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-09-009", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Brazilian grid operator expects PV, wind curtailment to reach 40 GW", "content": "<p>Brazil’s ONS warns that wind and solar curtailment could reach 40 GW annually by 2030 as renewable expansion outpaces demand growth and grid flexibility. The operator highlights transmission upgrades, storage, demand response, and better management of distributed generation as key measures to maintain system reliability.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/brazilian-grid-operators-expects-pv-wind-courtailment-to-reach-40-gw/\">Brazilian grid operator expects PV, win", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/brazilian-grid-operators-expects-pv-wind-courtailment-to-reach-40-gw/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-09-010", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Colombia commissions 360 MW solar plant", "content": "<p>Developed and constructed by Patria Investments, the project is currently among the largest operational PV facilities in Colombia, ranking second by installed capacity.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/colombia-commissions-360-mw-solar-plant/\">Colombia commissions 360 MW solar plant</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/colombia-commissions-360-mw-solar-plant/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "longi-2026-07-09-011", "date": "2026-07-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["longi"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "LONGi showcases solar+storage solution at The smarter E 2026", "content": "<p>In his interview at the event, LONGi Vice President Dennis She explains why the company is focusing on its full stack system and discusses plans to establish 15 local service centers across Europe.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/longi-showcases-solarstorage-solution-at-the-smarter-e-2026/\">LONGi showcases solar+storage solution at The smarter E 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/09/longi-showcases-solarstorage-solution-at-the-smarter-e-2026/", "type": "rss"}]}
